WEBVTT

00:00:01.870 --> 00:00:05.660
Saliva’s digestive enzyme is ptyalin.

00:00:05.660 --> 00:00:08.770
Gastric enzymes consist of pepsin and...

00:00:10.930 --> 00:00:13.170
Pepsin and gastric lipase.

00:00:13.170 --> 00:00:17.670
Pancreatic enzymes are trypsin, amylopsin, steapsin and nuclease.

00:00:17.670 --> 00:00:19.910
Yuuki-kun, how were you able to recite that?

00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:24.170
It’s because you’ve been reading that same page out loud god-knows how many times.

00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:28.490
There’s no way that I can’t remember
something that a middle schooler can...

00:00:28.490 --> 00:00:29.780
Fight, Kotoko-chan!

00:00:29.780 --> 00:00:31.900
Trypsin and amylopsin are nothing.

00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:34.360
Not you too, Mother.

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:37.430
Keita will get angry at me again.

00:00:37.430 --> 00:00:38.720
Who is this Keita?

00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:41.610
He’s my classmate, and very zealous about nursing.

00:00:42.670 --> 00:00:45.170
Idiot, you merely managed
to wrap the band right.

00:00:45.170 --> 00:00:47.310
Honestly, help me out here.

00:00:49.610 --> 00:00:53.630
Onii-chan, you should accompany Kotoko-chan for her studies.

00:00:53.630 --> 00:00:55.210
I don’t have that kind of free time.

00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:58.360
Sheesh! He’s so cold.

00:00:58.360 --> 00:00:59.840
It happens all the time anyway.

00:02:35.580 --> 00:02:40.840
The syringe needle should be 22 to 19 gauge in diameter.

00:02:41.300 --> 00:02:45.810
Thin needles will increase the likelihood of hemolysis and coagulation.

00:02:46.500 --> 00:02:50.210
So many things to remember one after another.

00:02:50.210 --> 00:02:52.410
Ah, Irie-kun! I’ve been waiting for you.

00:02:52.410 --> 00:02:53.740
Do you wanna have lunch together?

00:02:54.270 --> 00:02:55.820
Welcome!

00:02:56.730 --> 00:02:58.670
Chris, what are you doing?

00:02:58.670 --> 00:03:03.410
Kinnosuke always seems so busy, right? So, I’m lending him a hand during lunch.

00:03:03.410 --> 00:03:06.240
Honestly, I don’t need your help, idiot!

00:03:06.670 --> 00:03:09.550
Then, I’ll have a kitsune udon.

00:03:09.550 --> 00:03:10.690
I’ll have an oyakodon.

00:03:10.690 --> 00:03:12.280
Okay.

00:03:12.280 --> 00:03:15.850
Kinnosuke, one kitsune noodle and one family-don, please!

00:03:16.530 --> 00:03:17.890
Venipuncture Practical?

00:03:17.890 --> 00:03:20.380
Yes, first class of the afternoon.

00:03:20.380 --> 00:03:23.660
I’ve always been bad with needles.

00:03:24.570 --> 00:03:25.760
Gloom!

00:03:26.420 --> 00:03:29.270
The one in gloom would be the person you’re sticking a needle in.

00:03:29.270 --> 00:03:32.830
That’s right! Excuse me!

00:03:32.830 --> 00:03:36.750
You have it easy, since you’ll be getting your blood drawn by us accomplished students.

00:03:36.750 --> 00:03:37.740
Absolutely right.

00:03:38.220 --> 00:03:40.790
But, we have until class to decide, right?

00:03:40.790 --> 00:03:43.160
Hey, Tomoko, will you be my partner this time?

00:03:43.160 --> 00:03:47.410
That’s not fair, Moto-chan!
I’m partnering her. Right, Tomoko?

00:03:49.060 --> 00:03:52.090
Hey, wait! Don’t think that you can escape!

00:03:52.090 --> 00:03:53.420
I wasn’t attempting to...

00:03:53.880 --> 00:03:56.150
You don’t have to be so scared.

00:03:56.150 --> 00:03:59.300
That’s right, Irie-kun. Will you let me practice on you before class?

00:03:59.790 --> 00:04:01.160
Absolutely no!

00:04:01.160 --> 00:04:02.340
Of course you won’t.

00:04:02.790 --> 00:04:05.300
So, how are we going to decide the pairs?

00:04:05.740 --> 00:04:08.320
I’ll partner with Kotoko. That solves it, right?

00:04:10.710 --> 00:04:12.980
Have you gone mad?!

00:04:16.210 --> 00:04:17.070
What is it?

00:04:17.500 --> 00:04:19.430
Nothing. Well, good luck.

00:04:21.780 --> 00:04:23.410
I’m counting on you, Keita.

00:04:25.190 --> 00:04:27.850
You sure have some guts.

00:04:30.160 --> 00:04:30.910
Here it comes!

00:04:31.370 --> 00:04:33.670
You’ve been e-mailing a lot lately.

00:04:34.980 --> 00:04:38.580
Good luck on the blood draw practical. From Tsuyopon.

00:04:38.580 --> 00:04:40.000
Hey, don’t peek!

00:04:40.400 --> 00:04:42.600
What’s that? Who’s Tsuyopon?

00:04:43.670 --> 00:04:45.100
Secret.

00:04:51.620 --> 00:04:53.020
I’m getting goosebumps!

00:04:53.590 --> 00:04:57.120
Your drawn blood will be used by the medical department for training purposes later.

00:04:57.120 --> 00:05:00.800
So, please don’t forget to put your names on the label.

00:05:02.310 --> 00:05:05.270
First... First...

00:05:05.270 --> 00:05:07.530
First, you tie the tourniquet, right?

00:05:07.930 --> 00:05:09.750
Right, this comes first.

00:05:09.750 --> 00:05:11.640
Please tuck your thumb in.

00:05:11.640 --> 00:05:13.790
I’m going to make your blood vessel pop up.

00:05:15.960 --> 00:05:17.030
That’s too tight!

00:05:17.030 --> 00:05:17.710
Sorry.

00:05:18.770 --> 00:05:20.050
All done!

00:05:20.050 --> 00:05:21.960
See, it didn’t hurt, right?

00:05:21.960 --> 00:05:23.930
Tomoko is really skilled, isn’t she?

00:05:24.950 --> 00:05:25.860
That hurt!

00:05:25.860 --> 00:05:28.670
Sorry. I can’t find your blood vessel.

00:05:28.670 --> 00:05:30.300
Okay, one more time.

00:05:32.000 --> 00:05:33.980
Hey, that hurts!

00:05:33.980 --> 00:05:35.530
Don’t search using the needle!

00:05:36.860 --> 00:05:38.220
Poor thing.

00:05:38.220 --> 00:05:40.820
Kotoko-san, should I sub in for you?

00:05:41.260 --> 00:05:42.730
It might be better that way.

00:05:42.730 --> 00:05:44.440
It’s okay!

00:05:44.440 --> 00:05:47.090
But, Keita will be filled with scars like this.

00:05:47.590 --> 00:05:49.320
Well, he brought it upon himself.

00:05:49.710 --> 00:05:53.090
Don’t say that! Don’t you feel sorry for Keita?

00:05:53.090 --> 00:05:55.830
Eh? Could it be that Tomoko likes Keita?

00:05:58.360 --> 00:06:01.840
Sorry, we still haven’t collected all the samples.

00:06:02.220 --> 00:06:03.550
Kotoko-san, let me do it.

00:06:04.350 --> 00:06:07.380
Keita, you don’t want to suffer any more either, right?

00:06:07.380 --> 00:06:12.350
It’s okay. The training would be meaningless if we don’t let Kotoko finish.

00:06:12.350 --> 00:06:13.640
Come on, hurry.

00:06:20.120 --> 00:06:21.100
I did it!

00:06:22.550 --> 00:06:24.210
Well done.

00:06:24.210 --> 00:06:26.490
Keita, are you all right?

00:06:27.970 --> 00:06:29.830
You did it, Kotoko.

00:06:31.150 --> 00:06:34.070
Hurry, you have to take that to the medical department.

00:06:34.070 --> 00:06:35.620
I do, don’t I?

00:06:38.170 --> 00:06:40.500
Irie-kun, look! I managed to do it right!

00:06:41.690 --> 00:06:44.880
You were merely doing a blood draw.
What took you so long?

00:06:46.400 --> 00:06:48.180
Kotoko tried her best!

00:06:48.180 --> 00:06:50.380
As her husband, you should share her joy!

00:06:50.380 --> 00:06:55.310
Unfortunately, I’m not such a small-minded person that mixes work with household matters.

00:06:55.840 --> 00:06:59.330
It’s all right, Keita. It was my fault that he had to wait.

00:06:59.330 --> 00:07:00.920
Sorry, Irie-kun.

00:07:04.030 --> 00:07:07.210
Doesn’t it infuriate you being talked to so coldly like that?

00:07:07.210 --> 00:07:08.730
It happens all the time anyway.

00:07:08.730 --> 00:07:11.530
Irie-kun just doesn’t want to spoil me.

00:07:15.140 --> 00:07:19.420
Boiled spinach, spinach salad,
spinach miso soup...

00:07:19.420 --> 00:07:23.290
...spinach omelettes, and this one is spinach tempura.

00:07:23.290 --> 00:07:25.670
Is this a spinach festival?

00:07:25.670 --> 00:07:28.710
Kotoko-chan just had her blood drawn, so she needs the iron.

00:07:28.710 --> 00:07:30.490
I have some liver too. Here.

00:07:30.490 --> 00:07:31.420
Sorry about this.

00:07:31.930 --> 00:07:34.510
It must hurt to have your blood drawn.

00:07:34.510 --> 00:07:36.830
It depends on the skill of the person doing the blood draw, right?

00:07:36.830 --> 00:07:40.810
That reminds me. I heard that Tomoko’s venipuncture didn’t hurt at all.

00:07:40.810 --> 00:07:43.420
Tomoko-san is your classmate?

00:07:43.420 --> 00:07:46.490
Yes, she’s adorable like an angel.

00:07:46.490 --> 00:07:51.030
That’s right. It seems that Tomoko has a crush on Keita.

00:07:51.030 --> 00:07:53.620
I have to lend her my support.

00:07:53.620 --> 00:07:55.290
Keita is such a great guy after all.

00:07:56.470 --> 00:07:58.790
Who cares about that.

00:07:59.310 --> 00:08:00.750
Thanks for the meal.

00:08:00.750 --> 00:08:01.710
Irie-kun?

00:08:01.710 --> 00:08:04.690
He’s been in a foul mood lately.

00:08:04.690 --> 00:08:06.360
Come, let’s eat.

00:08:06.360 --> 00:08:08.790
Kotoko-chan, make sure you eat the liver too.

00:08:08.790 --> 00:08:10.000
Yes!

00:08:10.760 --> 00:08:13.110
This is liver, right?

00:08:13.110 --> 00:08:15.420
Yeah, what about it?

00:08:15.420 --> 00:08:17.660
We have more practical training next week...

00:08:19.180 --> 00:08:21.810
This day has finally arrived!

00:08:21.810 --> 00:08:26.380
Venipuncture is like child’s play compared to an autopsy, huh?

00:08:26.380 --> 00:08:29.040
What happens if we faint?

00:08:29.040 --> 00:08:32.300
I’m most worried for Tomoko.
Will you be all right?

00:08:32.300 --> 00:08:33.810
Will you be able to take it?

00:08:34.610 --> 00:08:38.290
It’ll be fine. We’ll put Keita behind her to catch her.

00:08:39.650 --> 00:08:44.130
If Tomoko faints, Keita will carry her with his strong arms.

00:08:44.130 --> 00:08:47.620
Then, Keita will run at full speed towards the medical office!

00:08:47.620 --> 00:08:51.880
And there, Keita will be gazing heavily upon Tomoko as she sleeps...

00:08:53.340 --> 00:08:56.640
Now why would I be looking at her face?

00:08:56.640 --> 00:08:59.480
Sheesh, this is what you get from a thickheaded guy.

00:09:01.040 --> 00:09:04.530
The medical students are presently performing an autopsy.

00:09:04.530 --> 00:09:06.610
First, let’s observe and learn.

00:09:07.450 --> 00:09:10.060
The air feels so chilly...

00:09:10.060 --> 00:09:12.110
Impossible! This really is impossible!

00:09:12.980 --> 00:09:14.270
Irie-kun!

00:09:14.270 --> 00:09:16.620
He looks wonderful in a surgical gown too!

00:09:17.460 --> 00:09:19.920
I want to wipe the sweat off of him.

00:09:19.920 --> 00:09:21.830
You can’t! I’ll be the one...

00:09:25.950 --> 00:09:29.550
How nice, they can touch the organs.

00:09:30.110 --> 00:09:32.580
Okay then, please let the nurses take over.

00:09:32.580 --> 00:09:33.680
Yes.

00:09:33.680 --> 00:09:37.740
It’s a precious cadaver, so please learn as much as you can from it.

00:09:37.740 --> 00:09:38.470
Yes...

00:09:39.450 --> 00:09:44.040
We give our thanks to the cadaver which has helped the medical students to progress.

00:09:44.040 --> 00:09:45.400
Please pray.

00:09:47.730 --> 00:09:49.380
Please put both your hands onto the cadaver.

00:09:49.380 --> 00:09:51.920
You may begin once you’ve offered your prayer.

00:09:52.870 --> 00:09:55.030
It’d be rude to feel scared.

00:09:55.030 --> 00:09:57.280
Just calm down and put out your arms.

00:09:57.280 --> 00:10:00.030
Best regards!

00:10:00.610 --> 00:10:03.070
What’s the point of offering a prayer to me?!

00:10:06.480 --> 00:10:09.140
I feel like my heart is gonna jump out!

00:10:09.140 --> 00:10:10.500
I’ll do it!

00:10:11.030 --> 00:10:13.500
I’m totally all right with this.

00:10:15.850 --> 00:10:18.650
So, this is the heart.

00:10:18.650 --> 00:10:19.760
Tomoko is actually...

00:10:19.760 --> 00:10:22.820
Please carefully observe the left and right chambers.

00:10:22.820 --> 00:10:25.360
Next, please observe the lungs. Next...

00:10:29.000 --> 00:10:30.150
Hey, Kotoko.

00:10:31.660 --> 00:10:32.900
Kotoko!

00:10:33.930 --> 00:10:38.660
Move it! Move it! You’re in my way!

00:10:40.000 --> 00:10:42.090
It must have been due to the autopsy.

00:10:42.090 --> 00:10:43.150
Oh, Irie.

00:10:43.870 --> 00:10:45.610
Something bad happened to your wife.

00:10:48.420 --> 00:10:50.470
Medicine...

00:10:50.470 --> 00:10:52.740
Bah, nothing useful here.

00:10:55.550 --> 00:10:58.390
That’s right. It must be hard
to breathe with that.

00:11:13.900 --> 00:11:15.730
What are you planning to do after that?

00:11:17.050 --> 00:11:18.700
You again?

00:11:20.040 --> 00:11:21.610
I wasn’t going to...

00:11:21.610 --> 00:11:23.530
Sorry for the trouble.

00:11:23.530 --> 00:11:26.940
I’ll watch over her.
Return to your practical.

00:11:30.330 --> 00:11:34.340
Don’t even think about laying a hand on someone else’s wife.

00:11:35.550 --> 00:11:37.630
Don’t think so highly of yourself.

00:11:37.630 --> 00:11:40.210
You treat Kotoko so coldly all the time.

00:11:40.210 --> 00:11:42.340
Don’t try to act like a husband only during times like these.

00:11:42.340 --> 00:11:44.850
You have no right to complain.

00:11:45.220 --> 00:11:46.320
I do!

00:11:46.320 --> 00:11:49.580
I’m more considerate towards Kotoko than you.

00:11:49.580 --> 00:11:52.100
I care for her better than you!

00:11:53.820 --> 00:11:55.110
Good for you.

00:12:14.630 --> 00:12:16.170
Hey, Irie.

00:12:16.570 --> 00:12:18.690
The instructor is calling. He wants you to come immediately.

00:12:18.690 --> 00:12:20.620
Okay. I’m going now.

00:12:30.140 --> 00:12:32.830
Kotoko isn’t coming back, is she?

00:12:32.830 --> 00:12:34.960
Maybe we should go check on her for a bit?

00:12:35.890 --> 00:12:37.270
Kotoko-san.

00:12:37.270 --> 00:12:38.790
How are you feeling?

00:12:38.790 --> 00:12:40.680
I’ll manage.

00:12:40.680 --> 00:12:41.650
Are you okay?

00:12:41.650 --> 00:12:44.570
I’m still feeling a little dizzy, I guess.

00:12:44.970 --> 00:12:46.860
What happened to him?

00:12:46.860 --> 00:12:48.040
Him?

00:12:48.040 --> 00:12:50.390
Never mind. I’ll walk you home.

00:12:50.390 --> 00:12:51.910
No, I’ll be fine.

00:12:51.910 --> 00:12:54.830
Don’t be unreasonable. Keita, please.

00:13:01.840 --> 00:13:05.430
I’m sorry. I keep causing you
nothing but trouble.

00:13:05.430 --> 00:13:07.410
Don’t worry about that.

00:13:08.440 --> 00:13:11.720
I’m really bad at everything I do.

00:13:11.720 --> 00:13:13.210
You’re trying your best.

00:13:14.280 --> 00:13:16.360
Have more self-esteem.

00:13:17.610 --> 00:13:19.400
Thank you.

00:13:21.480 --> 00:13:22.660
Kotoko-chan.

00:13:22.660 --> 00:13:24.290
Mother.

00:13:24.930 --> 00:13:26.410
Welcome back.

00:13:26.410 --> 00:13:28.150
This is Irie-kun’s mother.

00:13:28.150 --> 00:13:30.950
This is Kamogari Keita-kun, the one I mentioned before.

00:13:31.490 --> 00:13:33.000
Ah, the zealous one.

00:13:35.850 --> 00:13:38.870
I fainted during the autopsy practical.

00:13:39.300 --> 00:13:41.270
So, he walked me back.

00:13:41.270 --> 00:13:42.870
Oh dear. Are you okay?

00:13:42.870 --> 00:13:44.690
Yes. I’ve fully recovered.

00:13:44.690 --> 00:13:46.140
Sorry for the trouble.

00:13:46.580 --> 00:13:49.010
Not at all. Then, I’ll say goodbye here.

00:13:49.010 --> 00:13:50.710
Don’t strain yourself.

00:13:50.710 --> 00:13:51.640
Thanks.

00:13:58.150 --> 00:14:00.690
Sorry. I’m all right now.

00:14:00.690 --> 00:14:01.280
Really?

00:14:01.280 --> 00:14:01.650
Yes.

00:14:01.650 --> 00:14:02.740
You sure nothing is wrong?

00:14:02.740 --> 00:14:04.250
Yes, I’m fine.

00:14:04.250 --> 00:14:06.680
That’s good then. Be careful, okay?

00:14:06.680 --> 00:14:07.780
Yes.

00:14:10.730 --> 00:14:14.260
So, Kamogari-kun lives in the opposite direction?

00:14:14.260 --> 00:14:17.670
Yes. I told him that I’d be able to get back on my own though.

00:14:17.670 --> 00:14:19.490
How kind of him.

00:14:19.490 --> 00:14:21.580
And on the other hand, Onii-chan...

00:14:22.190 --> 00:14:26.280
You neglected her and came home late even though she had fainted.

00:14:26.280 --> 00:14:30.410
She won’t make it as a nurse fainting from something like that.

00:14:31.130 --> 00:14:32.080
You’re right.

00:14:32.080 --> 00:14:35.800
You’ll have to buck up if you really want to become a nurse.

00:14:37.240 --> 00:14:39.730
Just what was that?!

00:14:40.120 --> 00:14:43.760
It’s okay. What Irie-kun said was correct.

00:14:45.120 --> 00:14:48.990
Yeah, Irie-kun isn’t wrong.

00:14:51.080 --> 00:14:55.750
But, I wish that he’d worry about me,
even if it was just a little.

00:15:12.390 --> 00:15:15.190
You scared me. What are you doing?

00:15:15.190 --> 00:15:17.320
Something sure smells.

00:15:18.380 --> 00:15:20.080
I’m talking about Kamogari Keita.

00:15:20.080 --> 00:15:23.120
He might have a crush on Kotoko-chan.

00:15:23.120 --> 00:15:25.690
How could that be?
They’re just classmates, right?

00:15:25.690 --> 00:15:28.120
No, I’m sure he does!

00:15:28.120 --> 00:15:30.930
Kotoko-chan is so adorable after all.

00:15:31.820 --> 00:15:34.760
I knew this day would come.

00:15:34.760 --> 00:15:37.290
I never thought that it would.

00:15:37.790 --> 00:15:41.120
I have to investigate this thoroughly.

00:15:43.520 --> 00:15:46.550
Excuse me, gentlemen.

00:15:47.270 --> 00:15:50.340
Are you acquainted with Kamogari Keita from the nursing department?

00:15:50.870 --> 00:15:53.220
Kamogari... the one with the long hair?

00:15:53.220 --> 00:15:54.660
Yes, the long haired one.

00:15:54.660 --> 00:15:56.520
I was wondering what kind of person he was.

00:15:56.520 --> 00:15:59.850
What kind? He’s a nice guy and chivalrous.

00:15:59.850 --> 00:16:02.550
He’s very earnest and takes good care of others.

00:16:02.550 --> 00:16:03.880
I see.

00:16:04.220 --> 00:16:06.080
He’s very dependable, isn’t he?

00:16:06.080 --> 00:16:07.860
Yes, he’s quite my type.

00:16:12.140 --> 00:16:14.040
Everyone I ask gives the same answers.

00:16:14.040 --> 00:16:16.570
At this rate, Onii-chan’s position...

00:16:22.080 --> 00:16:24.730
I’m starting to feel dizzy...

00:16:25.830 --> 00:16:26.710
Careful!

00:16:28.140 --> 00:16:30.710
Ah, sorry.

00:16:32.500 --> 00:16:34.860
It’s because you’re wearing such clothes in this heat.

00:16:34.860 --> 00:16:36.940
You should take off that leather jacket.

00:16:36.940 --> 00:16:38.000
Okay.

00:16:38.000 --> 00:16:40.010
Why are you here today, Mrs. Irie?

00:16:40.010 --> 00:16:41.830
How do you know it’s me?

00:16:41.830 --> 00:16:43.200
Who wouldn’t be able to tell?

00:16:43.200 --> 00:16:46.190
Do you want to go to the medical office? It’s nearby, so I’ll show you there.

00:16:46.190 --> 00:16:48.960
No, I’ll be okay after a short rest.

00:16:48.960 --> 00:16:51.770
Anyway, you should replenish the fluids in your body.

00:16:51.770 --> 00:16:54.650
I just bought this, so if you’d like...

00:16:54.650 --> 00:16:56.620
Sorry about this.

00:16:57.040 --> 00:17:01.620
If you start feeling worse, there’s a medical office on the first floor of that building.

00:17:04.510 --> 00:17:07.080
What a kind young man!

00:17:07.080 --> 00:17:10.630
With that nice young man in the picture, cold-hearted Onii-chan wouldn’t stand a chance!

00:17:10.630 --> 00:17:13.000
I would choose him too!

00:17:13.000 --> 00:17:16.470
Kotoko-chan is going leave us for him!

00:17:18.540 --> 00:17:20.050
Mother?

00:17:20.050 --> 00:17:23.010
Yeah, she was wearing really thick clothes.

00:17:23.010 --> 00:17:25.590
I wonder what she came here for.

00:17:26.840 --> 00:17:28.550
Moto-chan.

00:17:30.400 --> 00:17:31.150
Moto-chan?

00:17:31.840 --> 00:17:34.650
Tsuyopon? The one you’ve been e-mailing?

00:17:35.260 --> 00:17:37.270
I got to know him over the Internet.

00:17:37.270 --> 00:17:39.280
We met for the first time yesterday.

00:17:39.280 --> 00:17:41.660
And I received an e-mail earlier.

00:17:41.660 --> 00:17:44.770
He told me never to contact him ever again!

00:17:44.770 --> 00:17:48.640
So in short, Tsuyopon thought that you were a girl?

00:17:48.640 --> 00:17:51.900
He was tricked by the talk of being a nurse trainee, wasn’t he?

00:17:51.900 --> 00:17:54.780
I didn’t trick him. Don’t speak ill of me.

00:17:54.780 --> 00:17:57.170
But, what about Irie-san, Moto-chan?

00:17:57.890 --> 00:18:01.270
He’s someone I admire who’s out of reach.

00:18:01.270 --> 00:18:04.890
Just when I thought I had found real love!

00:18:05.560 --> 00:18:07.750
Yes, yes. I know.

00:18:07.750 --> 00:18:10.100
Let’s go drinking tonight.

00:18:10.100 --> 00:18:11.620
You okay with that, Keita?

00:18:12.870 --> 00:18:13.940
Yeah.

00:18:14.350 --> 00:18:17.460
I’ll come too. You’ll be going too, right, Kotoko-san?

00:18:17.460 --> 00:18:21.700
I’m married, so I don’t think I should be going out at night so often.

00:18:21.700 --> 00:18:23.950
So, a girl’s friendship only amounts to that much?

00:18:25.160 --> 00:18:28.070
It shouldn’t be a problem if you get your husband’s permission, right?

00:18:28.070 --> 00:18:29.670
Why don’t you try asking Irie-san?

00:18:30.580 --> 00:18:33.050
Ah, speak of the devil.

00:18:33.050 --> 00:18:35.280
Come on, go ask him.

00:18:37.480 --> 00:18:38.840
Irie-kun.

00:18:38.840 --> 00:18:42.890
I was wondering if it’s all right for me to go drinking with the gang.

00:18:42.890 --> 00:18:44.420
The gang?

00:18:44.910 --> 00:18:47.300
Moto-chan is feeling heartbroken.

00:18:47.300 --> 00:18:50.710
Marina, Tomoko and Keita said they’ll go too.

00:18:51.510 --> 00:18:53.060
Just do as you please.

00:18:54.280 --> 00:18:56.700
Don’t ask me every little thing.

00:18:56.700 --> 00:18:59.890
Are you not able to decide a single thing by yourself?

00:19:00.800 --> 00:19:03.620
But, I was just...

00:19:09.100 --> 00:19:11.580
Fine then! I’ll do as I please!

00:19:14.410 --> 00:19:15.630
Keita!

00:19:17.480 --> 00:19:19.110
Drink!

00:19:19.110 --> 00:19:20.480
I am drinking.

00:19:20.890 --> 00:19:23.620
You act like you don’t care!

00:19:23.620 --> 00:19:26.730
Even though I’m feeling so depressed here!

00:19:26.730 --> 00:19:31.590
Cheer up. I’m sure someone who would treasure you more will appear.

00:19:32.310 --> 00:19:35.830
That’s right. Women are always treated well at first, then the man leaves.

00:19:35.830 --> 00:19:39.360
Just forget about that guy and move on to the next one.

00:19:39.360 --> 00:19:41.180
Excuse me, a refill please!

00:19:42.770 --> 00:19:46.220
Treated well then the man leaves, huh?

00:19:46.220 --> 00:19:48.160
I just can’t stand watching this.

00:19:48.840 --> 00:19:51.570
Well, it can’t be helped since he just got his heart broken.

00:19:51.570 --> 00:19:54.090
I’m not talking about Motoki. I’m talking about you.

00:19:56.310 --> 00:19:58.800
Why did you marry a guy like him?

00:20:05.140 --> 00:20:08.060
So, you let her go?

00:20:08.060 --> 00:20:10.900
It’s not something I should interfere with.

00:20:10.900 --> 00:20:12.880
Why are you being so carefree?

00:20:12.880 --> 00:20:15.230
That Kamogari boy is with her too, right?

00:20:15.230 --> 00:20:16.520
Seems like it.

00:20:16.520 --> 00:20:19.650
What are you going to do? Kotoko-chan is going to be taken at this rate!

00:20:20.460 --> 00:20:25.530
I’m sorry, but I really don’t believe that he loves you.

00:20:25.920 --> 00:20:27.970
It’s exactly as they’ve said.

00:20:27.970 --> 00:20:30.790
If he really did love you, then he’d treat you better.

00:20:35.510 --> 00:20:37.030
Sorry, I...

00:20:38.200 --> 00:20:40.800
I have to go home now.

00:20:40.800 --> 00:20:42.010
Mother will worry.

00:20:42.010 --> 00:20:44.920
Eh? Kotoko, you’re going already?

00:20:44.920 --> 00:20:47.230
Yeah, sorry. I’ll be going then.

00:20:48.330 --> 00:20:49.660
Kotoko!

00:20:56.780 --> 00:20:57.920
Wait!

00:21:01.330 --> 00:21:02.930
You’re right.

00:21:02.930 --> 00:21:05.730
Why did Irie-kun marry me?

00:21:10.850 --> 00:21:11.990
Kotoko...

00:21:15.970 --> 00:21:18.540
Don’t go back to him.

00:21:23.140 --> 00:21:26.060
Break up with him.

00:23:07.670 --> 00:23:10.570
What’s this, Irie? You look troubled.

00:23:10.570 --> 00:23:12.940
I don’t know. I don’t get it myself.

00:23:12.940 --> 00:23:16.830
It bothers me when I see Kamogari looking at Kotoko.

00:23:16.830 --> 00:23:18.580
You really don’t see it?

00:23:18.580 --> 00:23:19.660
What?

00:23:19.660 --> 00:23:21.710
Hah! This looks like fun, so I ain’t telling you!

00:23:21.710 --> 00:23:24.750
Even the genius has things he doesn’t get!

00:23:26.780 --> 00:23:28.630
Next time on Itazura na Kiss:

00:23:28.630 --> 00:23:30.730
Crazy for you.

00:23:30.730 --> 00:23:32.550
I’m definitely gonna be happy.
